    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.03",
    "summary": "During the active player's Movement phase, every one of that player's units carried inside a Transport model may get out through a Disembark Move (18.04). When a Transport model is destroyed, then, for every unit inside it, the active player has to resolve the Emergency Disembark Move (18.05), and do so before the Transport is taken off the battlefield.",
